BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Silence (2016)
DTSTART:20260423T023000Z
DTEND:20260423T053000Z
DTSTAMP:20260423T023000Z
UID:HZNAKflpsp
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 161 mins (2h41m)\n\nMartin Scorsese: Maestro of Cine
 ma Scorsese chose to show this spiritual thriller\, in which 17th-century 
 priests (Andrew Garfield\, Adam Driver) seek their missing mentor (Liam Ne
 eson) in Japan\, where Christianity is outlawed\, but a visionary voice st
 ill speaks. A meditation on Christian and Buddhist thought\, an illuminati
 on of physical and metaphysical faith. Scorsese as landscape painter.\n\nh
 ttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/martin-scorsese/silence\n\nEstimat
 ed start: 19:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
