DTEND:20260424T012500Z
DTSTAMP:20260423T231500Z
UID:0K0wUQWjPp
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 111 mins (1h51m)\n\nThis riveting portrait of "Democ
 racy Now!"'s Amy Goodman spotlights journalism's power—and peril—amid 
 rising corporate control and political attacks on the press. Q&A with sub
 ject Amy Goodman and filmmaker Carl Deal at the 7pm screenings on April 23
  and 24.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/steal-this-story-pleas
 e\n\nEstimated start: 16:30
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
